  <h1>Circle Grant Application: Sivan Technologies</h1>
  
  <div class="highlight-box">
    <strong>Project Summary:</strong> Sivan AI is a chat-first AI payment assistant operating natively on WhatsApp. It organizes service requests, documents service agreements, manages fee models (buyer-pays, seller-pays, or split 50/50), and coordinates protected transaction workflows entirely in chat — with zero Web3 onboarding required. This document presents the filled grant application, aligned with Sivan AI's official positioning, business model, and planned Circle USDC integrations.
  </div>

